OL,3,GNEWSAFire and rescue drone support
OL,4,Avolunteers get award
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo search and rescue charity
OL,7,Fvolunteers have said an award has given
OL,8,Fthem "a rare opportunity" for
OL,9,Frecognition.
OL,11,FIn May, David McMullen and Jon
OL,12,FWarburton from Berkshire Lowland Search
OL,13,Fand Rescue (BLSAR) supported
OL,14,Ffirefighters containing the fire at the
OL,15,FDaler-Rowney factory and main office in
OL,16,FBracknell.
OL,18,FMcMullen said their gathering drone
OL,19,Ffootage to give "another perspective"
OL,20,Fto the investigation had been
OL,21,F"invaluable" for the Royal Berkshire
OL,22,FFire and Rescue Service (RBFRS).
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
