OL,3,GNEWSAFire and rescue drone support
OL,4,Avolunteers get award
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity has been presented with a
OL,7,FPartner Recognition Award by (RBFRS)
OL,8,Ffor their assistance in the complex
OL,9,Foperation which was supported by six
OL,10,Fother fire services.
